config-connector-extensions patch 0011: mockgcp's Artifact Registry refuses to change a remote repository's source as the API does.

Written here, on top of patch 0005, for artifactregistry.gcp.hfl.dev
ArtifactRegistryRepository. A live run against a real project
(docs/live-runs.md, 2026-11-09) showed that an update whose mask is
remoteRepositoryConfig (Config Connector's direct controller sends it when
a remote repository's custom upstream URI changes) fails with 400 "Remote
source configuartion cannot be updated" (the API's spelling). mockgcp
already refused that path, with its generic "not supported by mockgcp";
now it gives the API's error, so a test can tell an immutable field from a
gap in the fake.

Upstream candidate: yes.

diff --git a/mockgcp/mockartifactregistry/repository.go b/mockgcp/mockartifactregistry/repository.go
index 1eddde3..60276e9 100644
--- a/mockgcp/mockartifactregistry/repository.go
+++ b/mockgcp/mockartifactregistry/repository.go
@@ -156,6 +156,11 @@ func (s *ArtifactRegistryV1) UpdateRepository(ctx context.Context, req *pb.Updat
 		case "remote_repository_config.upstream_credentials.username_password_credentials.password_secret_version",
 			"remoteRepositoryConfig.upstreamCredentials.usernamePasswordCredentials.passwordSecretVersion":
 			upstreamUsernamePasswordCredentials(obj).PasswordSecretVersion = req.Repository.GetRemoteRepositoryConfig().GetUpstreamCredentials().GetUsernamePasswordCredentials().GetPasswordSecretVersion()
+		case "remote_repository_config", "remoteRepositoryConfig":
+			// Real Artifact Registry refuses to change a remote repository's
+			// source, with this message (typo included), seen live
+			// (docs/live-runs.md in config-connector-extensions).
+			return nil, status.Errorf(codes.InvalidArgument, "Remote source configuartion cannot be updated")
 		default:
 			return nil, status.Errorf(codes.InvalidArgument, "update_mask path %q not supported by mockgcp", path)
 		}
